WEBVTT

00:03:26.357 --> 00:03:30.797
And the whole model is about
not only graduating students,

00:03:31.204 --> 00:03:35.034
but it is related to the impact 
that those quality institutions will have

00:03:35.034 --> 00:03:39.019
on the society and the public sector, 
and the private sector

00:03:39.019 --> 00:03:41.914
by introducing change into the way

00:03:41.914 --> 00:03:45.517
the different sectors 
of the society and the country

00:03:45.517 --> 00:03:47.497
and the region will function on.

00:03:47.497 --> 00:03:51.211
So, you need to look at Education City
beyond only the number of students.

00:03:51.495 --> 00:03:55.495
It is really a more, if you would like,

00:03:55.495 --> 00:03:58.635
renaissance type of project 
where you are really trying

00:03:58.635 --> 00:04:02.925
to reenergize everybody 
within the society,